      "terrain_suitability": {
        "passed": true,
        "detail": "FABDEM 30 m elevation successfully sampled for 233 points. 94 points in southern Chennai fall south of latitude 13.00014\u00b0N outside tile N13E080. 30 m resolution lacks street-level micro-drainage barriers, confirming that elevation alone cannot predict flooding."
      },
